# Vale's downloaded style packages. `vale sync` fetches Google from the
# package registry into .vale/styles/Google/, which is third-party
# content on its own release cadence -- pinned in .vale.ini and in the
# workflow, not vendored.
#
# Named EXACTLY, not as .vale/styles/* with a re-inclusion: that form
# also drops .vale/styles/Shape/, which is our own rule set and has to
# be committed.
.vale/styles/Google/
